<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title><%= title %></title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/resurse/CSS/general.css"></head>
<body>
<header><h1>Comenzi (demonstratie ON DELETE CASCADE)</h1></header>
<main>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>id</th><th>data</th><th>linii</th><th>facturi</th><th>recenzii</th><th>actiuni</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <% (comenzi||[]).forEach(c=>{ %>
    <tr>
      <td>#<%= c.id_comanda %></td>
      <td><%= c.data %></td>
      <td><%= c.linii %></td>
      <td><%= c.facturi %></td>
      <td><%= c.recenzii %></td>
      <td>
        <form method="post" action="/admin/comenzi/<%= c.id_comanda %>/delete" onsubmit="return confirm('sterge comanda si tot ce depinde de ea prin cascade?')">
          <button>sterge</button>
        </form>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <% }) %>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>la stergere, postgres elimina automat in lant liniile din <code>produs_comanda</code>, <code>factura</code> si <code>recenzie</code> datorita <em>ON DELETE CASCADE</em> din schema</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
